# Honest limits:
# - The retry absorbs ONE transient error; two consecutive transient failures still fail (as designed) with "transient, 2 attempts".
# - The budget is 20s total, each attempt has an 8s socket timeout; no retry for policy refusals (R-100 address guard untouched).
# - The live `test_researcher_live_duckduckgo` passing is consistent with (not proof of) the retry absorbing the flake; the discriminating
#   unit tests (mocked transport) prove the retry logic itself.
